#: src/onboarding.py:707
msgid "Can't save face model"
msgstr "Impossible d'enregistrar lo modèl facial"

#: src/onboarding.py:712 src/onboarding.py:759
msgid "Scan second model"
msgstr "Capturar lo segond modèl"

#: src/onboarding.py:718
msgid "Couldn't record the second model"
msgstr "Impossible d'enregistrar lo segond modèl"

#: src/onboarding.py:719
msgid ""
"Your first model is saved, so face login already works. The room must still "
"be bright enough to see your face — change the light rather than turning it "
"off — then try again, or skip and add a model later from Settings."
msgstr ""
"Vòstre primièr modèl es enregistrat, doncas la connexion per reconeissença "
"faciala fonciona ja. Mas la sala deu demorar pro clara per veire vòstra cara "
"— cambiatz la lutz puslèu que de l'atudar — puèi tornatz ensajar, o ignoratz "
"aquesta etapa e apondètz un modèl pus tard dins los Paramètres."

#: src/onboarding.py:753
msgid "Second scan: glasses, facial hair or different lighting"
msgstr "Segonda captura: lunetas, barba o esclairatge diferent"

#: src/onboarding.py:755
msgid ""
"First model saved: face login already works. A second model makes "
"recognition more reliable when something changes: put on the glasses you "
"sometimes wear (or take them off), or record it with different facial hair, "
"and change the light — turn a lamp on or off, move away from the window. "
"Keep your face clearly visible and press Scan again; the same short guided "
"capture follows."
msgstr ""
"Primièr modèl enregistrat: la connexion per reconeissença faciala fonciona "
"ja. Un segond modèl rend la reconeissença mai fisabla quand quicòm càmbia: "
"metètz las lunetas que portatz de còps (o levatz-las), o enregistratz-lo amb "
"una autra barba, e cambiatz la lutz — alucatz o atudatz un lum, alunhatz-vos "
"de la fenèstra. Gardatz vòstra cara plan visibla e quichatz un còp de mai "
"sus Capturar; lo meteis enregistrament cort e guidat seguís."

#: src/onboarding.py:797
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> Checking TPM hardware and tools..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello pòt desblocar automaticament vòstre {} amb l'autentificacion "
"faciala (pòrtafuelh detectat: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Estat del TPM:</b> verificacion del material e dels espleches TPM..."

#: src/onboarding.py:817
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected. Installing <i>tpm2-tools</i> "
"automatically..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello pòt desblocar automaticament vòstre {} amb l'autentificacion "
"faciala (pòrtafuelh detectat: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Estat del TPM:</b> material TPM detectat. Installacion automatica de "
"<i>tpm2-tools</i>..."

#: src/onboarding.py:829
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> Hardware TPM 2.0 active. Your password will be securely "
"sealed inside the TPM."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello pòt desblocar automaticament vòstre {} amb l'autentificacion "
"faciala (pòrtafuelh detectat: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Estat del TPM:</b> material TPM 2.0 actiu. Vòstre senhal serà sagelat "
"d'un biais segur dins lo TPM."

#: src/onboarding.py:831
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected, but automatic installation of "
"<i>tpm2-tools</i> failed. Run <code>sudo apt install tpm2-tools</code>. "
"Falling back to software-based credential caching."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello pòt desblocar automaticament vòstre {} amb l'autentificacion "
"faciala (pòrtafuelh detectat: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Estat del TPM:</b> material TPM detectat, mas l'installacion automatica "
"de <i>tpm2-tools</i> a fracassat. Executatz <code>sudo apt install tpm2-"
"tools</code>. Retorn a la mesa en cache logiciala dels identificants."

#: src/onboarding.py:833
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> No TPM hardware detected. Using software-based credential "
"caching (AES-256-GCM)."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello pòt desblocar automaticament vòstre {} amb l'autentificacion "
"faciala (pòrtafuelh detectat: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Estat del TPM:</b> cap de material TPM detectat. Utilizacion de la mesa "
"en cache logiciala dels identificants (AES-256-GCM)."

