#: src/main.ui:445
msgid ""
"A desktop notification shows while Ubuntu Hello looks for your face, then "
"reports the result. Failed attempts stay in the notification list."
msgstr ""
"Una notificacion de burèu s'aficha pendent qu'Ubuntu Hello cèrca vòstra "
"cara, puèi dona lo resultat. Las temptativas fracassadas demòran dins la "
"lista de las notificacions."

#: src/main.ui:476
msgid "Show notifications"
msgstr "Afichar las notificacions"

#: src/main.ui:482
msgid ""
"One card per face-authentication attempt, updated in place with the result."
msgstr ""
"Una carta per cada temptativa d'autentificacion faciala, actualizada sul "
"luòc amb lo resultat."

#: src/main.ui:513
msgid "Notification sounds"
msgstr "Sons de notificacion"

#: src/main.ui:519
msgid "Play the system sound for a recognized or failed attempt."
msgstr "Jogar lo son del sistèma per una temptativa reconeguda o fracassada."

#: src/main.ui:550
msgid "Include diagnostics"
msgstr "Inclure los diagnostics"

#: src/main.ui:556
msgid ""
"Add the model, certainty vs. threshold, frames, camera and timing to each "
"card. Useful when reporting a problem."
msgstr ""
"Apond a cada carta lo modèl, la certitud fàcia al sulhet, los fotogramas, la "
"camèra e la durada. Util per senhalar un problèma."

#: src/main.ui:618 src/main.ui:734
msgid "Security"
msgstr "Seguretat"

#: src/main.ui:633
msgid ""
"How closely your face has to match, and whether Ubuntu Hello asks you to "
"confirm that you are really there."
msgstr ""
"Quant vòstra cara deu correspondre exactament, e se Ubuntu Hello vos demanda "
"de confirmar que i sètz vertadièrament."

#: src/main.ui:657
msgid "Face match strictness"
msgstr "Rigor de la correspondéncia faciala"

#: src/main.ui:665 src/onboarding.ui:151
msgid "Fast"
msgstr "Rapid"

#: src/main.ui:672 src/onboarding.ui:182
msgid "Balanced"
msgstr "Equilibrat"

#: src/main.ui:680 src/onboarding.ui:213
msgid "Secure"
msgstr "Segur"

#: src/main.ui:702 src/onboarding.ui:250
msgid "Ask me to nod to confirm"
msgstr "Me demandar de sinhar del cap per confirmar"

#: src/main.ui:708 src/onboarding.ui:259
msgid ""
"After your face matches, a notification asks you to nod. A photo held up to "
"the camera cannot nod."
msgstr ""
"Un còp vòstra cara reconeguda, una notificacion vos demanda de sinhar del "
"cap. Una fòto tenguda davant la camèra pòt pas sinhar del cap."

#: src/main.ui:771 src/onboarding.ui:759
msgid "Keyring / KWallet Auto-Unlock"
msgstr "Desblocatge automatic del clavèr / KWallet"

#: src/main.ui:786
msgid ""
"Enable face authentication to automatically unlock your login keyring or "
"KWallet on login. This securely stores your password sealed in the TPM when "
"available, or encrypted with AES-256-GCM using a root-only master key. Face "
"auth sets PAM_AUTHTOK for pam_gnome_keyring or pam_kwallet5 depending on "
"your desktop."
msgstr ""
"Activatz l'autentificacion faciala per desblocar automaticament vòstre "
"clavèr de connexion o KWallet a la connexion. Aquò garda vòstre senhal d'un "
"biais segur, sagelat dins lo TPM quand es disponible, o chifrat en AES-256-"
"GCM amb una clau mèstra accessibla pas qu'a root. L'autentificacion faciala "
"definís PAM_AUTHTOK per pam_gnome_keyring o pam_kwallet5 segon vòstre burèu."

