"<a href=\"https://github.com/ventura8/ubuntu-hello\">Open GitHub link</a> "
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"https://github.com/ventura8/ubuntu-hello\">Dobrir lo ligam GitHub</"
"a> "

#: src/main.ui:1020
msgid ""
"<a href=\"https://github.com/ventura8/Ubuntu-Hello/issues\">Report a problem "
"or suggest a feature</a>"
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"https://github.com/ventura8/Ubuntu-Hello/issues\">Senhalar un "
"problèma o prepausar una foncionalitat</a>"

#: src/main.ui:1032
msgid "About"
msgstr "A prepaus"

#: src/onboarding.ui:9 src/onboarding.ui:14
msgid "Welcome to Ubuntu Hello"
msgstr "Benvenguda dins Ubuntu Hello"

#: src/onboarding.ui:52
msgid "Setup is done!"
msgstr "La configuracion es acabada!"

#: src/onboarding.ui:68
msgid ""
"We're done! Ubuntu Hello is now active on this computer. Try doing anything "
"you would normally have to type your password for to authenticate, like "
"running a command with sudo. If you enabled keyring auto-unlock, your login "
"keyring or KWallet will also be unlocked automatically on login.\n"
"\n"
"You can open the Ubuntu Hello Configurator later on to change more advanced "
"settings or add additional models. Press Finish below to close this window "
"and open the Ubuntu Hello Configurator. "
msgstr ""
"Es acabat! Ubuntu Hello es ara actiu sus aqueste ordenador. Ensajatz de far "
"quicòm que vos demandariá normalament de picar vòstre senhal per vos "
"autentificar, coma executar una comanda amb sudo. S'avètz activat lo "
"desblocatge automatic del clavèr, vòstre clavèr de connexion o KWallet serà "
"tanben desblocat automaticament a la connexion.\n"
"\n"
"Podètz dobrir mai tard lo Configurador Ubuntu Hello per cambiar de "
"paramètres mai avançats o apondre de modèls suplementaris. Quichatz sus "
"Acabar çai-jos per tampar aquesta fenèstra e dobrir lo Configurador Ubuntu "
"Hello. "

#: src/onboarding.ui:105
msgid "Setting a certainty policy"
msgstr "Definir una politica de certitud"

#: src/onboarding.ui:121
msgid ""
"Because of changes in angles, distance, and other factors a face match is "
"never exactly the same as the stored face model. On this page you can set "
"how strict Ubuntu Hello should be."
msgstr ""
"A causa dels cambiaments d'angle, de distància e d'autres factors, una "
"correspondéncia faciala es jamai exactament identica al modèl facial "
"enregistrat. Sus aquesta pagina, podètz definir quina rigor deu aplicar "
"Ubuntu Hello."

#: src/onboarding.ui:160
msgid ""
"The most forgiving match and the quickest to let you in. Choose this if "
"convenience matters more than strictness."
msgstr ""
"La correspondéncia mai indulgenta e la mai rapida per vos daissar dintrar. "
"Causissètz aquò se la comoditat compta mai que la rigor."

#: src/onboarding.ui:191
msgid ""
"A strict match that still logs you in quickly. It may not recognise you at a "
"sharp angle or from further away."
msgstr ""
"Una correspondéncia estricta que vos connècta totjorn lèu. Benlèu que vos "
"reconeisserà pas dins un angle agut o de mai luènh."

#: src/onboarding.ui:223
msgid "The strictest match, with no extra step when you log in. Recommended."
msgstr ""
"La correspondéncia la mai estricta, sens etapa suplementària a la connexion. "
"Recomandat."

#: src/onboarding.ui:379
msgid "Skip for now"
msgstr "Ignorar pel moment"

#: src/onboarding.ui:384
msgid ""
"You can add more face models later from Settings or with: sudo ubuntu-hello "
"add"
msgstr ""
"Podètz apondre d'autres modèls facials pus tard dins los Paramètres o amb: "
"sudo ubuntu-hello add"

#: src/onboarding.ui:403 src/onboarding.ui:531
msgid "Configuring webcam"
msgstr "Configuracion de la webcam"

#: src/onboarding.ui:435
msgid "Is the infrared emitter flashing ?"
msgstr "L'emeteire infraroge s'aluca ?"

#: src/onboarding.ui:447
msgid ""
"Look at the camera you selected: an infrared camera shows a small light that "
"blinks while Ubuntu Hello tests it. This tells us whether it can see your "
"face in the dark."
msgstr ""
"Agachatz la camèra qu'avètz causida: una camèra infraroja mòstra un pichon "
"lum que s'aluca e s'atuda pendent qu'Ubuntu Hello la tèsta. Aquò nos ditz "
"s'es capabla de veire vòstra cara dins l'escur."

#: src/onboarding.ui:481
msgid "Yes, it flashes"
msgstr "Òc, un lum s'aluca"

#: src/onboarding.ui:507
msgid "No, nothing flashes"
msgstr "Non, s'aluca pas res"

#: src/onboarding.ui:547
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello will search your system automatically for any available "
"cameras, so make sure your webcam is connected. After detection a list of "
"usable webcams will be shown. Pick the one you want to use and click Next."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello cercarà automaticament sus vòstre sistèma totas las camèras "
"disponiblas, doncas asseguratz-vos que vòstra webcam es connectada. Aprèp la "
"deteccion, una lista de las webcams utilizablas s'afichará. Causissètz "
"aquela que volètz utilizar e clicatz sus Seguent."

#: src/onboarding.ui:566
msgid "Testing your webcams, please wait..."
msgstr "Tèst de vòstras webcams, esperatz un moment..."

#: src/onboarding.ui:613
msgid "Downloading data files"
msgstr "Telecargament dels fichièrs de donadas"

#: src/onboarding.ui:629
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello needs three pre trained facial recognition datasets to be able "
"to recognise you, which will be downloaded now. You can see the download "
"progress below."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello a besonh de tres jòcs de donadas de reconeissença faciala "
"preentraïnats per vos poder reconéisser; van èsser telecargats ara. Podètz "
"seguir l'avançament del telecargament çai-jos."

#: src/onboarding.ui:653
msgid "Starting download..."
msgstr "Aviada del telecargament..."

#: src/onboarding.ui:697
msgid "Welcome to Ubuntu Hello!"
msgstr "Benvenguda dins Ubuntu Hello!"

#: src/onboarding.ui:709
msgid "Version"
msgstr "Version"

#: src/onboarding.ui:723
msgid ""
"This wizard will walk you through the setup process and automatically "
"configure Ubuntu Hello for you. Press next to continue."
msgstr ""
"Aqueste assistent vos guidarà dins lo procediment de configuracion e "
"configurarà automaticament Ubuntu Hello per vos. Quichatz sus seguent per "
"contunhar."

#: src/onboarding.ui:775
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your login keyring or KWallet using "
"face authentication, preventing password prompts after logging in."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello pòt desblocar automaticament vòstre clavèr de connexion o "
"KWallet amb l'autentificacion faciala, çò qu'evita las demandas de senhal "
"aprèp la connexion."

#: src/onboarding.ui:787
msgid "Enable automatic keyring/KWallet unlocking"
msgstr "Activar lo desblocatge automatic del clavèr/KWallet"

#: src/onboarding.ui:815
msgid "Confirm password"
msgstr "Confirmar lo senhal"

#: src/onboarding.ui:872
msgid "Back"
msgstr "Precedent"

#: src/onboarding.ui:907
msgid "Finish setup"
msgstr "Acabar la configuracion"

#: src/onboarding.ui:934
msgid "Next"
msgstr "Seguent"

#: ubuntu-hello-gtk.desktop.in
msgid "Windows Hello style facial authentication"
msgstr "Autentificacion faciala a l'estil de Windows Hello"

#: ubuntu-hello-gtk.desktop.in
msgid "face;recognition;authentication;security;lock;"
msgstr "cara;reconeissença;autentificacion;seguretat;blocatge;"
